# Ariza formasini yuborish manzili. Ikkalasidan birini tanlang (yoki bo'sh qoldiring).
# Bo'sh bo'lsa — "Yozilish" tugmasi ariza matni bilan Telegram'ni ochadi (src/content/site.ts → brand.telegram).

# 1) Formspree: https://formspree.io da forma yarating va manzilni qo'ying
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx

# 2) Web3Forms: https://web3forms.com dan access key oling
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FORM_ACCESS_KEY=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
